<title>RUSSIA: Rouble fixed at 3,402 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble fixed at 3,402 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was set at 3,402 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    May 27		  May 26</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,402		   3,416</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
